らで結構です。\nなにとぞ御一考のほど、よろしくお願い申し上げます。", "nc": 176, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 42236, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "足乃ちまど", "screen_name": "ashinochimado", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037780470285643776/BOvSZnsT.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3228036938/1773301428/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 372436, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "入る🔞", "screen_name": "ilillilillilill", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1907093807545671680/LihrKmNz.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/140317659/1401572712/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 552135, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "千鳥ねころ@ヒカバザ→名華祭→コミティア", "screen_name": "ne_koromo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1969809687106424832/PK7dhor2.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1574002355812503553/1777286156/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 655416, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptab